Step-by-Step
1. Pretrained Model

A model already trained by others.

Examples:

MobileNet
YOLO
VGG16
FaceNet
ResNet
2. Prediction

The model predicts something from the input.

Example:

Input Image → Model → "Person"

or

Camera → Model → "Mask Detected"
3. Call to Action

Based on the prediction, perform an action.

Example:

| Prediction       | Action             |
| ---------------- | ------------------ |
| Person Detected  | Open Door          |
| Mask Detected    | Allow Entry        |
| Fire Detected    | Send Alert         |
| Garbage Full     | Notify Corporation |
| Vehicle Detected | Open Gate          |

============

4. AI Application

The action becomes a complete AI application.

