Formula for Building AI Projects

Pretrained Model + Prediction + Action = AI Application

Examples:

Pretrained Model	Prediction	Action	AI Application
MobileNet	Mask	Alert	Mask Detection
FaceNet	Face	Mark Attendance	Smart Attendance
YOLO	Garbage	Send Alert	Garbage Monitoring
YOLO	Vehicle	Open Gate	Smart Parking
ResNet	Disease	Show Result	Plant Disease Detection
Main Idea

The Pretrained Model only gives a prediction.
Your project becomes unique because of the action you perform after the prediction.

For example:

Same YOLO model → Garbage Detection System
Same YOLO model → Traffic Monitoring System
Same YOLO model → Smart Parking System

The difference is the "Call to Action", not the model itself.

why call to action 3 nos, and AI application 3 nos

The 3 "Call to Action" boxes and 3 "AI Application" boxes are just examples to show that one prediction can be used in multiple ways.

Example

Suppose the pretrained model predicts:

"Person Detected"

Then you can create different actions:

| Prediction      | Call to Action      | AI Application             |
| --------------- | ------------------- | -------------------------- |
| Person Detected | Open Door           | Smart Door System          |
| Person Detected | Mark Attendance     | Attendance System          |
| Person Detected | Send Security Alert | Security Monitoring System |

=========

So:

Same Prediction
      ↓
  Action 1 → AI App 1
  Action 2 → AI App 2
  Action 3 → AI App 3
