Why 3 Boxes?

The number 3 has no special meaning.

The diagram could have:

2 actions → 2 AI applications
5 actions → 5 AI applications
10 actions → 10 AI applications

The author used 3 boxes only for illustration.

Main Message

Pretrained Model
        ↓
    Prediction
        ↓
Many Different Actions
        ↓
Many Different AI Applications
=========


That is the core idea of the diagram. One pretrained model can be reused to build many different AI projects by changing the action after the prediction.

